flowchart TD

    A([handleRomConfig]) --> B[Send Content-Type Header]
    B --> C{HTTP POST?}

    C -- No --> Z[Continue to HTML Generation]

    C -- Yes --> D{ROM assignment?}

    %% ROM Assignment
    D -- Yes --> D1[Read position and ROM]
    D1 --> D2{Position 0-13?}

    D2 -- No --> E

    D2 -- Yes --> D3{ROM = Not Assigned?}

    D3 -- Yes --> D4[Clear romTable entry]
    D4 --> D5[Set temperature to -196.6]
    D5 --> D8[Save ROM Table]

    D3 -- No --> D6{Valid ROM?}
    D6 -- Yes --> D7[Update romTable]
    D7 --> D8

    D6 -- No --> D9[Print Invalid ROM]

    D8 --> E
    D9 --> E
    D -- No --> E

    %% Graph Limits
    E{Graph limits supplied?}

    E -- Yes --> E1[Read miny/maxy]
    E1 --> E2{0 ≤ Min < Max ≤ 200?}

    E2 -- Yes --> E3[Update graphMinY & graphMaxY]
    E3 --> E4[Save Graph Limits]
    E4 --> F

    E2 -- No --> F

    E -- No --> F

    %% POST URL
    F{POST URL supplied?}

    F -- Yes --> F1[Read URL]
    F1 --> F2{Valid HTTP URL?}

    F2 -- Yes --> F3[Save POST URL]
    F3 --> G

    F2 -- No --> F4[Print Invalid URL]
    F4 --> G

    F -- No --> G

    %% Recipients
    G[Loop through 6 Recipient Emails]
    G --> G1{Email field exists?}

    G1 -- Yes --> G2[Validate Email]
    G2 --> G3[Update recipient_emails]
    G3 --> G4[Recipients Changed?]

    G4 -- Yes --> G5[Save Recipients]
    G5 --> H

    G4 -- No --> H

    G1 -- No --> H

    %% Sender Credentials
    H[Update Sender Credentials]
    H --> H1[Validate Sender Email]
    H1 --> H2[Update Password]
    H2 --> H3{Credentials Changed?}

    H3 -- Yes --> H4[Save Sender Credentials]
    H4 --> I

    H3 -- No --> I

    %% Operator Variables
    I[Update Operator Variables]
    I --> I1[Aux Sleep]
    I1 --> I2[OLED Flag]
    I2 --> I3[Debug Flag]
    I3 --> I4[Save Operator Variables]

    I4 --> J[Redirect to /romconfig]
    J --> K[HTTP 303 Response]
    K --> L([Return])
